# ==========================================
# PROJECT JAGAR SENGHDA - CUSTOM EXCLUSIONS
# ==========================================

# 1. On-Device ML Models & Weights 
# Ignores quantized ONNX and whisper.cpp binary models to prevent repository bloating[span_0](start_span)[span_0](end_span)[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span).
assets/models/*.onnx
assets/models/*.bin
assets/models/*.pt

# 2. SQLite Database Temporary Files 
# Ignores temporary shared memory and write-ahead log files created by the Local Competency Store running in SQLite WAL mode[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span).
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# 3. Android NDK & C++ Native Build Artifacts 
# Ignores compiled native C++ binaries required for the background execution of whisper.cpp and Piper TTS[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span).
**/android/.cxx/
**/android/obj/
**/android/libs/
*.o
*.a
*.so

# 4. Generated Curriculum Resources
# Ignores locally generated vector canvas PDF worksheets mapped to the NIPUN Bharat framework[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span).
/assets/generated_pdfs/
*.pdf
